100
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:21,740
but you have to be such a plain and gloomy little wretch!

101
00:04:22,660 --> 00:04:24,620
You made Mother mad again!

102
00:04:26,260 --> 00:04:30,180
Get back to cleaning and take care of the laundry and dishes too while you're at it!

103
00:04:30,780 --> 00:04:31,540
I'm trying!

104
00:04:31,540 --> 00:04:34,160
You're covered in soot! How disgusting!

105
00:04:35,580 --> 00:04:38,920
Then again, your name is Gray, so it's only right for you to be dusty!

106
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:41,220
Yes, it really suits her!

107
00:04:42,040 --> 00:04:46,240
You should get even dustier to cover up how embarrassingly ugly you are!

108
00:04:47,500 --> 00:04:51,460
That's true! It'll be better if you walk around covered in soot all the time!

109
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:54,100
Mother, look at this!

110
00:04:54,720 --> 00:04:59,020
My goodness, that spell is so beautiful! Just like the two of you!

111
00:04:59,020 --> 00:05:01,160
Next, dear! I can do that too!

112
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:10,100
I'm sorry! I didn't mean to!

113
00:05:10,640 --> 00:05:13,320
What are you doing spying on us, you ugly girl?

114
00:05:13,320 --> 00:05:16,580
She's probably jealous of the beautiful magic that we can do!

115
00:05:16,940 --> 00:05:19,940
She's so hideous! She can only dream of pulling that off!

116
00:05:19,940 --> 00:05:28,520
A laggard like you isn't capable of magic that's useful, let alone beautiful!

117
00:05:28,820 --> 00:05:30,660
Step to your chores! Am I clear?

118
00:05:30,660 --> 00:05:32,280
Um, yes!

119
00:05:32,280 --> 00:05:51,500
I have nothing, and I always get yelled at for being a failure!

120
00:05:51,500 --> 00:06:01,560
But if I work as hard as I can, maybe my stepmother and stepsisters will change their minds!

121
00:06:01,560 --> 00:06:08,820
So, you've been sneaking around and shirking your chores in favor of practicing magic!

122
00:06:09,340 --> 00:06:11,160
Have you at least learned any decent spells?

123
00:06:11,940 --> 00:06:15,040
It's been five years since you got your grimoire, hasn't it?

124
00:06:15,240 --> 00:06:18,520
Even a dullard like you must have mastered something by now!

125
00:06:19,320 --> 00:06:20,900
Go ahead, show us a spell!

126
00:06:20,900 --> 00:06:27,000
I'm sure it'll be sad and embarrassing, just like you are, but give it your best!

127
00:06:31,240 --> 00:06:33,420
Now I can be like you two!

128
00:06:36,980 --> 00:06:39,140
How dare you try to imitate us!

129
00:06:40,420 --> 00:06:43,200
We're the ones who are giving these gorgeous faces by mother!

130
00:06:43,540 --> 00:06:45,160
You have no right to look this way!

131
00:06:45,320 --> 00:06:47,240
Change yourself back right this instant!

132
00:06:47,580 --> 00:06:50,560
I'm sorry, I haven't learned how to change back yet!

133
00:06:50,900 --> 00:06:53,120
You're a wolf of an idiot!

134
00:06:53,520 --> 00:06:54,540
