173
00:08:44,340 --> 00:08:46,600
Up until then, I'd had nothing.

174
00:08:48,700 --> 00:08:50,600
But that was what I needed.

175
00:08:51,640 --> 00:08:53,700
Not long after that...

176
00:08:54,780 --> 00:08:57,580
You know what?

177
00:08:57,600 --> 00:08:58,220
