Yeah, yeah.

190
00:09:23,820 --> 00:09:24,680
She's an angel!

191
00:09:25,280 --> 00:09:25,780
Gushu...

192
00:09:25,780 --> 00:09:26,320
Gushu...

193
00:09:26,320 --> 00:09:30,280
I was able to see you again.

194
00:09:30,280 --> 00:09:33,800
Maybe I'm going overboard by calling it fate.

195
00:09:33,800 --> 00:09:37,480
But you were the one who led me to the Black Bulls.

196
00:09:39,200 --> 00:09:40,780
The place I belong.

197
00:09:40,780 --> 00:09:47,860
I don't want to lose a single one of my dear friends!

198
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:53,940
You gave me a reason to keep living, and...

199
00:09:53,940 --> 00:09:57,280
No matter what you look like, you're still Grey.

200
00:10:00,200 --> 00:10:04,400
Because of you, I found friends that I could trust, like family.

201
00:10:07,200 --> 00:10:09,940
I want to save you, and...

202
00:10:10,940 --> 00:10:13,860
It's embarrassing, but I want you to look at me more!

203
00:10:13,860 --> 00:10:17,520
And see how strong I've become!

204
00:10:21,900 --> 00:10:22,620
Grey.

205
00:10:25,060 --> 00:10:26,700
She sealed the wound.

206
00:10:27,500 --> 00:10:30,120
I didn't know her transformation magic could do that.

207
00:10:32,700 --> 00:10:34,340
What is this spell?

208
00:10:34,340 --> 00:10:36,520
Hey, Grey.

209
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:38,340
How'd you...

210
00:10:38,340 --> 00:10:43,600
Asta!

211
00:10:49,600 --> 00:10:50,160
Magnificent!

212
00:10:50,740 --> 00:10:53,040
Yet another arcane stage fighter!

213
00:10:54,440 --> 00:10:57,620
Your abilities are going to waste in this place.

214
00:10:57,880 --> 00:10:58,780
It's been decided.

215
00:10:59,920 --> 00:11:02,260
You'll both be my women now.

216
00:11:04,340 --> 00:11:11,100
That's my squad.

217
00:11:11,600 --> 00:11:13,320
So keep your mitts off of them.

218
00:11:24,320 --> 00:11:24,840
Captain!

219
00:11:26,180 --> 00:11:27,400
Well then.

220
00:11:28,260 --> 00:11:30,820
You must be Yamisuke Hiro.

221
00:11:30,820 --> 00:11:35,220
And you must be a devil possessed from spade.

222
00:11:36,060 --> 00:11:37,640
But I don't give a damn.

223
00:11:38,620 --> 00:11:41,840
Because whoever you are, I'm about to slaughter you.

224
00:11:43,560 --> 00:11:44,820
I like your malice.

225
00:11:45,680 --> 00:11:47,580
That said, you're out of line.

226
00:11:48,720 --> 00:11:49,760
Gravity magic.

227
00:11:50,140 --> 00:11:51,900
Presence of the Demon King.

228
00:11:51,900 --> 00:11:54,740
I can't control my portal.

229
00:11:54,740 --> 00:11:54,800
I can't control my portal.

230
00:11:57,980 --> 00:11:58,900
Oh?

231
