So you refuse to genuflect.

232
00:12:03,880 --> 00:12:05,100
How bold of you.

233
00:12:05,880 --> 00:12:08,280
I've learned a lot in the last six months.

234
00:12:09,120 --> 00:12:10,920
Time to try it out.

235
00:12:12,040 --> 00:12:12,720
Monosone.

236
00:12:12,720 --> 00:12:14,480
And black hole.

237
00:12:21,480 --> 00:12:22,360
Dark magic.

238
00:12:22,800 --> 00:12:23,880
Black moon.

239
00:12:25,960 --> 00:12:26,720
Interesting.

240
00:12:27,720 --> 00:12:30,700
Any of my magic within that field is being erased.

241
00:12:30,700 --> 00:12:33,860
So this is dark magic.

242
00:12:34,160 --> 00:12:35,040
That's fine.

243
00:12:36,160 --> 00:12:40,440
I'll send this boulder flying at top speed and crush you with the inertia.

244
00:12:41,780 --> 00:12:42,700
Dark magic.

245
00:12:42,960 --> 00:12:43,580
Dark close.

246
00:12:43,720 --> 00:12:44,840
Dimension slash.

247
00:12:44,840 --> 00:12:52,900
He cut through space.

248
00:12:52,900 --> 00:12:56,500
Impressive.

249
00:12:57,060 --> 00:12:59,660
Precisely why I've been searching for you.

250
00:13:01,920 --> 00:13:03,400
Gravity magic.

251
00:13:04,100 --> 00:13:06,340
Heavy infighting gladiator.

252
00:13:07,120 --> 00:13:08,000
He's fast.

253
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:22,920
I'm using Monosone and predicting his moves by reading his key.

254
00:13:23,720 --> 00:13:25,480
He's not on Julius's level.

255
00:13:26,600 --> 00:13:29,600
But he can control the speed of his sword using gravity.

256
00:13:31,180 --> 00:13:34,060
I was right about you, Yamisuke hero.

257
00:13:34,060 --> 00:13:36,760
Have you been stalking me or something, you weirdo?

258
00:13:36,760 --> 00:13:39,240
Because you're starting to creep me out to something fierce.

259
00:13:39,700 --> 00:13:40,100
Stalking?

260
00:13:40,200 --> 00:13:42,640
Well, you're the one I'm after, so I suppose so.

261
00:13:42,800 --> 00:13:43,440
Look, pal.

262
00:13:43,680 --> 00:13:47,600
It's going to be hard for me to take that as a compliment when it's coming from the likes of you.

263
00:13:47,840 --> 00:13:51,020
You are a key that connects this world to the underworld.

264
00:13:52,560 --> 00:13:53,040
Underworld?

265
00:13:53,600 --> 00:13:56,820
Take that creepy crap and shove it where the sun don't shine!

266
00:13:57,840 --> 00:13:59,180
My, what a shame.

267
00:13:59,180 --> 00:14:03,920
I wasn't expecting Yamisuke hero to be so vulgar and shabby in person.

268
00:14:04,080 --> 00:14:04,860
Say that again!

